<title>USA: Publishing Co says sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Publishing Co says sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE HELEN, Fla. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publishing Company of North America said Thursday it authorized the repurchase of up to $1 million of its outstanding shares of common stock, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchases are expected to be made in open market transactions from time to time over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The stock closed at three on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
